{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113343","id":3055998326,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc62JtV2","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113343","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113343.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113343.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113343","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113343/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113343/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113343/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/83f91604d9a3e3c20d9b42520f4d27ff4c47c418","number":113343,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"C#: Generate interfaces for all Godot classes to enable unit testing","user":{"login":"Hazzajenko","id":106005914,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlGFmg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106005914?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hazzajenko","html_url":"https://github.com/Hazzajenko","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hazzajenko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hazzajenko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hazzajenko/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hazzajenko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hazzajenko/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hazzajenko/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hazzajenko/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hazzajenko/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hazzajenko/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Related to godotengine/godot-proposals#432\n\nGodot C# classes are concrete, so they cannot be mocked in unit tests. This generates interfaces for all Godot classes during mono glue generation. Classes automatically implement their interfaces, so you can mock them with NSubstitute.\n\nExample:\n\n```csharp\n// Before: Cannot mock\npublic class Player {\n    private Node2D _sprite;\n    private Node2D _spriteChild;\n}\n\n// After: Can inject interface and mock\npublic class Player {\n    private INode2D _sprite;\n    private INode2D _spriteChild;\n\n    public Player(INode2D sprite) {\n        _sprite = sprite;\n        _spriteChild = _sprite.GetNode<INode2D>(\"child\");\n    }\n}\n\n// Unit test\nvar spriteMock = Substitute.For<INode2D>();\nvar spriteChildMock = Substitute.For<INode2D>();\nspriteMock.GetNode<INode2D>(Arg.Is<NodePath>(p => p == \"child\")).Returns(spriteChildMock);\n\nvar player = new Player(spriteMock);\n```\n\nAdded `_generate_cs_interface()` and helpers to `bindings_generator.cpp`. Interfaces are generated alongside class files. Also added partial interfaces for generic methods (`INodeExtensions`, `IPackedSceneExtensions`).\n\nGenerated `INode2D.cs`:\n```csharp\n/// <summary>\n/// <para>A 2D game object, with a transform (position, rotation, and scale).</para>\n/// </summary>\npublic interface INode2D : ICanvasItem\n{\n    /// <summary>\n    /// <para>Position, relative to the node's parent.</para>\n    /// </summary>\n    Vector2 Position { get; set; }\n\n    // ... all other properties and methods\n}\n```\n\nGenerated `Node2D.cs` now implements the interface:\n```csharp\npublic partial class Node2D : CanvasItem, INode2D\n{\n    public Vector2 Position\n    {\n        get { return GetPosition(); }\n        set { SetPosition(value); }\n    }\n\n    // ...\n}\n```\n\nNote: This creates interfaces like `ILogger` in the `Godot` namespace which may conflict with existing code. For example, `GodotIdeManager.cs` needed `private class GodotLogger : ILogger` changed to `private class GodotLogger : GodotTools.IdeMessaging.ILogger`.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_ur